msgstr "Ibi Ìpamọ́ Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Ìpéye Àmì-àkókò"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Ìṣedéédé milisẹ́kọ́ǹdù ń fi àwọn àmì-àkókò syslog tí ó kéré ju ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá lọ pamọ́ sínú òpó TIMESTAMP(3) ó sì wà lórí MariaDB nìkan. Ìṣedéédé ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá ń lo òpó TIMESTAMP ìbílẹ̀. Lórí ètò iṣẹ́ gidi, lo cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms lásìkò ìtọ́jú láti yí àwọn ìránṣẹ́ tí ó ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀ padà láì da wọ́n nù."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Milisẹ́kọ́ǹdù - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB nìkan)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Ìṣiṣẹ́ Ìfiranṣẹ́ Òkèèrè"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Mú Ìṣiṣẹ́ Ìránṣẹ́ Olùkójọpọ̀ Dátà Ọ̀nà Jíjìn ṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Tí Àwọn Olùkójọpọ̀ Dátà Ọ̀nà Jíjìn rẹ bá ní ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà Syslog tiwọn tí wọ́n sì ń ṣe ìṣiṣẹ́ àwọn ìránṣẹ́ wọn lọ́tọ̀, ṣàmì sí àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí. Nípa ṣíṣàmì sí Àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí, Àwọn Olùkójọpọ̀ Dátà Ọ̀nà Jíjìn rẹ yóò nílò láti tọ́jú fáìlì 'config_local.php' tiwọn láti lè sọ fún Syslog láti lo ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà òmìnira fún ìṣàfihàn àti ìṣiṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́. Jọ̀wọ́ lo fáìlì Àdàkọ 'config_local.php.dist' fún ìdí yìí. ÌKÌLỌ̀: A óò ṣẹ̀dá àwọn tábìlì Syslog lọ́nà àdánidá nígbà tí àṣàyàn yìí bá ti wà ní Ṣiṣẹ́."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Ìmúṣọ̀kan Àwọn Òfin Olùkó Dátà Òkèèrè"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Tí Àwọn Olùkójọpọ̀ Dátà Ọ̀nà Jíjìn rẹ bá ní ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà Syslog tiwọn tí wọ́n sì ń ṣe ìṣiṣẹ́ àwọn ìránṣẹ́ wọn lọ́tọ̀, ṣàmì sí àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí tí o bá fẹ́ kí a fi àwọn òfin Ìtanijí, Ìyọkúrò àti Ìròyìn ti ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà Cacti Pàtàkì ránṣẹ́ sí Ètò Cacti Ọ̀nà Jíjìn."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Tọ́jú Àwọn Àkọsílẹ̀ sí Olùkójọ Òkèèrè"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Pa àwọn ìránṣẹ́ tí a ti ṣiṣẹ́ lé lórí mọ́ sínú tábìlì syslog ti olùkójọ òkèèrè lẹ́yìn tí a bá ti fi wọ́n ránṣẹ́ sí Olùkójọ Àkọ́kọ́. Nígbà tí ó bá wà ní àìṣiṣẹ́, àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ni a ó máa tọ́jú ní agbègbè nìkan nígbà tí Olùkójọ Àkọ́kọ́ kò bá sí lárọ̀ọ́wọ́tó, a ó sì yọ wọ́n kúrò lẹ́yìn ìjẹ́rìísí ìfìránṣẹ́ ìpadàbọ̀."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Ìlànà Ìpamọ́"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Yan iye ọjọ́ àwọn iye Syslog tí o fẹ́ tọ́jú sínú ibi ìpamọ́ dátà."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Ìpele Ìpín"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n ìpín kọ̀ọ̀kan ti àwọn tábìlì syslog àti syslog_removed.  Ojoojúmọ́ ni a dámọ̀ràn.  Wákàtí kọ̀ọ̀kan nílò ìtọ́jú tí ó ní òpin, àti pé ìtọ́jú àti ìpele ìpínsíwẹ́wẹ́ papọ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ bá ààlà ìpín olùpèsè ibùdó dátà mu.  Láti yí ìpele náà padà lẹ́yìn náà, yí i padà nínú Àwọn Ètò kí o sì ṣiṣẹ́ cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Ìgbéga"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Fi sílẹ̀"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Olùdámọ̀ràn %s Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "ÌKÌLỌ̀: Ìgbéga Syslog Ń Gba Àkókò Púpọ̀!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Ìgbéga tábìlì syslog 'main' lè jẹ́ ìlànà tó ń gba àkókò púpọ̀. Nítorí náà, a dámọ̀ràn pé kí o dín ìwọ̀n tábìlì syslog rẹ kù ṣáájú ìgbéga, tàbí kí o yan àṣàyàn abẹ́lẹ̀."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Tí o bá yan àṣàyàn abẹ́lẹ̀, tábìlì Syslog àtijọ́ rẹ yóò gba orúkọ tuntun, a óò sì ṣẹ̀dá tábìlì Syslog tuntun kan. Lẹ́yìn náà, a óò bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìlànà ìgbéga ní abẹ́lẹ̀. Lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, ìlànà abẹ́lẹ̀ yìí lè gba àkókò púpọ̀ láti parí. Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, a óò pa dátà rẹ mọ́."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Láìka àṣàyàn rẹ sí, gbogbo àwọn òfin ìyọkúrò àti ìtanijí tí ó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ ni a ó pa mọ́ nígbà ìlànà ìgbésókè."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Tẹ <b>'Ìgbéga'</b> láti tẹ̀síwájú pẹ̀lú ìgbéga náà, tàbí <b>'Fagilé'</b> láti padà sí àtòjọ Àwọn Àfikún."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "O tún lè ṣètò ẹ̀rọ ìpamọ́ ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà fún àwọn tábìlì ìtúpalẹ̀ syslog àti syslog_remove.  Ẹ̀rọ ìpamọ́ InnoDB nìkan àti, lórí MariaDB, ẹ̀rọ ìpamọ́ Aria ni a ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún.  Tí o bá ń lo MariaDB, a gbani nímọ̀ràn Ẹ̀rọ Ìpamọ́ Aria nígbà tí kò bá sí àwọn àṣàyàn Olùkójọ Dátà Òkèèrè tí ó ṣiṣẹ́; àwọn àṣàyàn olùkójọ béèrè fún InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "O ní ọ̀pọ̀ àṣàyàn láti yan lára wọn nígbà tí o bá ń fi Syslog sí i.  Èkíní ni Ìṣètò Ibùdó Dátà.  Àwọn tábìlì tí a pín sí abala ni ìṣètò kan ṣoṣo tí a ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún nítorí pé wọ́n ń dènà kí ìwọ̀n àwọn tábìlì má baà pọ̀ jù tí yóò sì dín ìwádìí kù.  Àwọn tábìlì àtijọ́ tí a kò pín sí abala ti di àkójúgbẹ́, a kò sì pèsè wọn mọ́ fún àwọn ìfisílẹ̀ tuntun."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "O tún lè yan ìpẹ̀kun àkókò àmì-àkókò.  Ìpẹ̀kun ìdá-ẹgbẹ̀rún ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá (TIMESTAMP(3)) máa ń pa ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ abẹ́-ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá ti àwọn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ tó ń wọlé mọ́, ó sì wà lórí MariaDB nìkan; àwọn ìfisílẹ̀ MySQL ń lo ìpẹ̀kun ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá.  A kò lè yí èyí padà ní ibi kan náà lẹ́yìn náà láìpa àwọn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ tí a pamọ́ run."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Ibi ìpamọ́ Aria kò sí nígbà tí èyíkéyìí àṣàyàn Olùkójọ Dátà Òkèèrè bá wà ní ṣiṣẹ́. A ti yan InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "O tún lè yan àkókò ìpamọ́.  Jọ̀wọ́ rántí pé tí o bá ní ọ̀pọ̀ àwọn olùgbàlejò tó ń kọsílẹ̀ sí syslog, tábìlì yìí lè tóbi púpọ̀."

