#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Gba àwọn òfin tí a ṣètò sí Olùṣàkóso Ìtànijí láàyè láti fi àwọn ìtànijí ránṣẹ́ síwájú. Ímeèlì Syslog ṣì wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ààbò ìgbẹ̀yìn; àwọn ìṣe àṣẹ máa ń ṣiṣẹ́ fún àwọn òfin Ìtànijí Syslog nìkan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Yọ Àwọn Dòmẹ́ìnì Kúrò"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Àtòjọ àwọn agbègbè ìkànnì tí àmì idánudúró pín sí tí o fẹ́ yọ kúrò lára orúkọ olùgbàlejò Syslog, Àpẹẹrẹ yóò jẹ́ 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Ààrin Ìsọdọ̀tun"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Èyí ni àkókò ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá kí ojú-ewé tó tún sọ ara rẹ̀ dọ̀tun."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Fò Àpapọ̀ Ìka Ìlà"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Tí a bá ṣàmì sí àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí, àwọn àbùlà Àkọsílẹ̀ Ètò àti Àkọsílẹ̀ Ìtanijí kò ní ka gbogbo àkọsílẹ̀ tí ó báramu, èyí tí ó lè ná ìṣiṣẹ́ púpọ̀ lórí àwọn ìfisílẹ̀ ńlá. Ojú-ewé náà yóò fi àwọn ìjápọ̀ Tẹ́lẹ̀ àti Tókàn hàn dípò àpapọ̀ àti àkójọ ojú-ewé, a óò sì fúnni ní Tókàn nígbà tí àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ mìíràn bá ṣì wà."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Àwọn Àkọsílẹ̀ Ìjábọ̀ Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Fún àwọn Ìtanijí tí ó dá lórí Àlà, kí ni iye tí ó pọ̀ jùlọ tí o fẹ́ fi hàn nínú ìròyìn. Èyí ni a fi ń dín ìwọ̀n àkọsílẹ̀ html àti Ímeèlì kù."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "Àwọn Àkọsílẹ̀ %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìlànà Ìṣiṣẹ́ Syslog Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ṣètò rẹ̀ ju 1 lọ, ìṣiṣẹ́ ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ tó ń wọlé máa ń pín káàkiri àwọn ìṣiṣẹ́ òṣìṣẹ́ aláfọ̀wọ́sowọ́pọ̀.  Òṣìṣẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan ń ṣàkóso àgbègbè ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ tó yàtọ̀, èyí tó ń mú kí ìtúmọ̀ orúkọ olùgbàlejò àti gbígbé ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ yára sí i lábẹ́ ẹrù wúwo.  Ètò 1 máa ń ṣiṣẹ́ gbogbo ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ nínú ìṣiṣẹ́ kan ṣoṣo.  Àwọn ìṣiṣẹ́ òṣìṣẹ́ kò ní àtìlẹ́yìn lórí Windows tàbí nígbà tí àwọn àfikún PHP pcntl àti POSIX kò bá sí, nígbà náà ìṣiṣẹ́ yóò padà sí ìṣiṣẹ́ kan ṣoṣo."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "Ìlànà Ìṣiṣẹ́ Olùṣe %d"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìlànà Ìṣiṣẹ́ Olùṣe %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Àṣẹ fún Ṣíṣí Àwọn Tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "A ó ṣe àṣẹ yìí fún ṣíṣí Àwọn Tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì Help Desk. Àṣẹ náà yóò nílò láti ṣàyẹ̀wò ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn pàrámítà ìtẹ̀wọlé gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìsàlẹ̀ yìí: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. Àkójọ olùgbàlejò yóò jẹ́ àkójọ àwọn olùgbàlejò tí ìkìlọ̀ náà kàn tí a fi kọ́mà pín."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Àwọn Àṣàyàn Ìwárí Olùgbàlejò"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Mú Ìtúmọ̀ Orúkọ Olùgbàlejò ṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Tí a bá ṣàmì sí àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí, gbogbo orúkọ Olùgbàlejò yóò jẹ́ wíwá nípasẹ̀ ìwádìí DNS lákọ̀ọ́kọ́ (Tí ó bá wà ní Ṣiṣẹ́), nípa lílo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ A àti AAAA. Àwọn àdírẹ́sì IPv4 àti IPv6 kò nílò ìwádìí, a sì ń tọ́jú àwọn àdírẹ́sì IPv6 ní ìrísí lẹ́tà kékeré tí a fún pọ̀. Tí ìwádìí DNS bá kùnà, ètò náà yóò gbìyànjú láti wá orúkọ Olùgbàlejò náà pẹ̀lú tábìlì Olùgbàlejò Cacti kí ó sì fi àpèjúwe Olùgbàlejò Cacti rọ́pò rẹ̀. Tí ìwádìí DNS àti Cacti bá kùnà, a óò fún àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ní ìṣáájú 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Fò Ìtumọ̀ DNS fún àwọn Olùgbàlejò tó ń bọ̀"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Tí a bá ṣàmì sí àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí, ètò náà kò ní gbìyànjú láti túmọ̀ àwọn Olùgbàlejò nípasẹ̀ ìwádìí DNS. Èyí wúlò fún àwọn àyíká níbi tí ìtúmọ̀ DNS kò ti ṣeé ṣe tàbí tí a kò fẹ́ ẹ."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Ìfitónilétí HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Mú Ímeèlì Tí Ó Dá lórí HTML ṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Tí a bá ṣàmì sí àpótí àyẹ̀wò yìí, gbogbo Ímeèlì yóò jẹ́ fífiránṣẹ́ ní ìrísí HTML. Bíbẹ́ẹ̀kọ́, Ímeèlì yóò jẹ́ fífiránṣẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀ lasan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Fáìlì Ìṣètò-ìrísí Láti Lò"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Yan àpò html àdáni àti fáìlì CSS láti lò.  Fáìlì yìí ní html àti CSS méjèèjì láti wé yí ìjábọ̀ rẹ ká.  Tí ó bá ní ju CSS lásán lọ, o nílò láti fi àmì <REPORT> pàtàkì kan sínú fáìlì náà.  Àkóónú ìjábọ̀ náà yóò rọ́pò àmì ìṣètò-ìrísí yìí.  Àwọn fáìlì wọ̀nyí wà nínú àtòjọ-fáìlì 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Ìtọ́jú Dátà àti Pípín sí Apá"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Ìpamọ́ Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Èyí ni iye ọjọ́ láti tọ́jú àwọn ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n ìpín kọ̀ọ̀kan ti àwọn tábìlì syslog àti syslog_removed. A fi àyípadà pamọ́ síbí ṣùgbọ́n yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ṣiṣẹ́ nìkan nígbà tí cli/upgrade_partitioning.php bá tún àwọn tábìlì méjèèjì kọ; títí di ìgbà náà, ìtọ́jú ìpín yóò pa ìwọ̀n tí ó wà mọ́. Ìpínsíwẹ́wẹ́ wákàtí kọ̀ọ̀kan nílò ìtọ́jú tí ó ní òpin. Ìtọ́jú, fèrèsé ìṣẹ̀dá-tẹ́lẹ̀ àti ìpele ìpínsíwẹ́wẹ́ papọ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ bá ààlà ìpín olùpèsè ibùdó dátà mu, tàbí a kò ní fi àwọn ètò náà pamọ́."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìṣẹ̀dá Ìpín Tẹ́lẹ̀"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Èyí ni iye ọjọ́ àwọn ìpín ọjọ́ iwájú láti tọ́jú fún àwọn tábìlì Syslog tí a pín, kí a lè máa pín àwọn ìpín tuntun láti inú ìpín dMaxValue tí ó ṣófo nígbà gbogbo. Ìpín wákàtí máa ń tọ́jú ó kéré jù ọjọ́ 2 nígbà gbogbo."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Ọjọ́ %d"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Ọjọ́ %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Ààlà Ìgbàpadà Ìpín"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Nígbà tí àwọn ìpín bá sọnù (fún àpẹẹrẹ lẹ́yìn àkókò ìsinmi ìtọ́jú), ó pọ̀ jù iye àwọn ìpín tó sọnù yìí fún tábìlì kọ̀ọ̀kan ni a máa ń dá sílẹ̀ ní ìṣiṣẹ́ olùṣàyẹ̀wò kọ̀ọ̀kan.  Àlàfo tó kù yóò pé lórí àwọn ìṣiṣẹ́ tó tẹ̀lé e; ìgéwọ́ ìpamọ́ yóò dúró títí tí ojú-ọ̀nà ìpín ọjọ́ iwájú yóò fi padà bọ̀ sípò pátápátá.  Ó kan àwọn tábìlì Syslog tí a pín nìkan."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "Ìpín %d fún ìṣiṣẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "Ìpín %d fún ìṣiṣẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Àlà Àtijọ́ Olùkójọ"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Àwọn ìtanijí ìlera ọ̀nà ìṣiṣẹ́ máa ń kìlọ̀ nígbà tí àwọn ìfiranṣẹ́ tí a kò tíì ṣe, ìparí ìṣiṣẹ́, tàbí ìṣọ̀kan tí ó wà lórí ìlà bá kọjá ìdádúró yìí. Ìdádúró gidi kò dín sí ààlà àkókò Olùṣàyẹ̀wò mẹ́ta àti ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá 300. Ṣètò sí 0 láti lo ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá 300."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Àìyípadà (ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá 300)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Backlog Threshold"
msgstr "Àlà Àṣẹ́kù Olùkójọ"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
msgstr "Ojú-ewé Ipò Syslog máa ń fi ìkìlọ̀ hàn nígbà tí ìránṣẹ́ tó ju iye yìí lọ bá jókòó láìṣiṣẹ́ nínú tábìlì Àbáwọlé Syslog. Ṣètò sí 0 láti lo àìyípadà ìránṣẹ́ 10000."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (10000 messages)"
msgstr "Àìyípadà (ìfiránṣẹ́ 10000)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Messages"
msgstr "Ìfìránṣẹ́ %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìtanijí Ìlera Ọ̀nà Ìṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Àtòjọ Ìfitọ́nilétí Ìlera Ọ̀nà Ìṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Yan àkójọ ìfitónilétí Thold tó wà fún àwọn ìkìlọ̀ ìlera ọ̀nà ìṣiṣẹ́. Àwọn olùgbà àkójọ tó Ṣiṣẹ́ ni a ó dà pọ̀ mọ́ àwọn àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì ní ìsàlẹ̀, pẹ̀lú pípa àwọn olùgbà BCC mọ́. Àwọn àkójọ nílò tábìlì àkójọ ìfitónilétí Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Àwọn Olùgbà Ímeèlì Ìlera Ọ̀nà Ìṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Àwọn olùgbà ímeèlì tí a fi kọ́mà yà sọ́tọ̀ fún ìkùnà àti ìpadàbọ̀ ọ̀nà iṣẹ́. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo kí o sì má ṣe yan àtòjọ ìfitónilétí kankan láti ṣe àìṣiṣẹ́ ímeèlì; ìlera yóò máa hàn lórí tábù Ipò, a ó sì kọ àwọn àyípadà ipò sílẹ̀. Àwọn àyẹ̀wò nílò kí Olùṣàyẹ̀wò Cacti ṣiṣẹ́."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Ààlà Àkókò Ìránnilétí Ìlera Ọ̀nà Ìṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Tún àwọn ìfitónilétí ṣe fún àwọn ìṣòro ìlà iṣẹ́ tí ó ń lọ lọ́wọ́ lẹ́yìn àlàfo yìí. A kò ní gbìyànjú àwọn ìgbìyànjú ímeèlì tí ó kùnà ju ẹ̀ẹ̀kan lọ ní gbogbo ìṣẹ́jú márùn-ún."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Ìpamọ́ Ìtanijí Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Èyí ni iye ọjọ́ láti tọ́jú àwọn àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìtànijí."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Ìdádúró Ìfiyèsí àti Ìtọ́jú"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Àwọn Ọjọ́ Àkókò Ìtọ́jú"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Àwọn ọjọ́ tí gbogbo ìfitónilétí ìtanijì yóò wà ní ìdákẹ́jẹ́ẹ́ ní àkókò ìtọ́jú tí a ṣètò."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìtọ́jú Bẹ̀rẹ̀"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Àkókò ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ abẹ́lé fún fèrèsé ìtọ́jú àgbáyé."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìtọ́jú Parí"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Àkókò ìparí abẹ́lé fún fèrèsé ìtọ́jú àgbáyé. Àkókò ìparí tó ṣáájú yóò tẹ̀síwájú sínú ọjọ́ kejì."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Àtúnṣe Lẹ́ẹ̀kan Péré Bẹ̀rẹ̀"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Ọjọ́ àti àkókò àdúgbò àṣàyàn láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ fèrèsé àtúnṣe gbogbogbòò lẹ́ẹ̀kan péré."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Àtúnṣe Lẹ́ẹ̀kan Péré Parí"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Ọjọ́ àti àkókò àdúgbò àṣàyàn láti parí fèrèsé àtúnṣe gbogbogbòò lẹ́ẹ̀kan péré. Ìrísí: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìsinmi Ìtanijì Àìyípadà"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Dá ìfitónilétí àtúnṣe èyíkéyìí dúró fún òfin kan náà àti ààlà ìròyìn fún iye ìṣẹ́jú yìí. Àwọn iye fún òfin kọ̀ọ̀kan lè borí ètò yìí. Ṣètò sí 0 láti sọ ọ́ di àìṣiṣẹ́."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Ìdènà Ẹ̀dà-méjì Àìyípadà"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
