msgstr "Kó Òfin Ìròyìn Wọlé láti Fáìlì Abẹ́lé"

#: syslog_reports.php
msgid "If the XML file containing the Report Rule definition data is located on your local machine, select it here."
msgstr "Tí fáìlì XML tí ó ní dátà ìtumọ̀ Òfin Ìròyìn bá wà lórí ẹ̀rọ abẹ́lé rẹ, yàn án níbí."

